{"unit_id":"tag:0GJE:proof","translation":"由于<MATH_0001>稠密（dense），可见<MATH_0002>具有维数（dimension）<MATH_0003>，从而为有限集（finite set）<MATH_0004>，由<MATH_0005>-有理点（rational points）组成。考虑短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0006>\n，它来自引理<REF_0001>。注意<MATH_0007>。具体地，<MATH_0008>为闭浸入（closed immersion），从而有限（finite），故有<MATH_0009>在<MATH_0010>时的消没，由命题<REF_0002>得到，因此此等式由 Leray 谱序列（spectral sequence）（景上上同调（Cohomology on Sites）引理<REF_0003>）得到。由于<MATH_0011>为代数闭（algebraically closed）域（fields）的谱（spectra）的不交并（disjoint union），得到<MATH_0012>，对<MATH_0013>成立，以及\n<MATH_0014>\n，这是有限（finite）<MATH_0015>-模（module）；<MATH_0016>有限（finite），由假设<MATH_0017>为可构造（constructible）层（sheaf），其取值为<MATH_0018>-模（modules）得到。长正合（long exact）上同调（cohomology）列（sequence）给出正合列（exact sequence）\n<MATH_0019>\n，以及同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0020>，对<MATH_0021>成立。此引理容易由此推出。\n","allowed_english":["Leray"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"dense","target_term":"稠密"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"finite set","target_term":"有限集"},{"source_term":"rational points","target_term":"有理点"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上上同调"},{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭"},{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"spectra","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"long exact","target_term":"长正合"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合列"},{"source